    <paragraph>Factor the Greatest Common Factor from a Polynomial</paragraph>
    <paragraph>In the following exercises, factor the greatest common factor from each polynomial.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="19" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$4x + 20$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$4 ( x + 5 ) 4 ( x + 5 )$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="20" has_solution="false">
