        <paragraph>What is the GCF of $$y^{4},y^{5}, \text{and} y^{10}$$ ? Write a general rule that tells you how to find the GCF of $$y^{a},y^{b}, \text{and} y^{c}$$ .</paragraph>
      </problem>
